<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; PR 1, 2, 3 and 4 are independent and can run side by side.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; PR 5 is the join point: a fresh clone following the README, then the smoke script.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Longest chain: any of PR 1&amp;ndash;4 &amp;rarr; 5 (2 PRs in sequence)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="780" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>